Show what is forwarded in from outside

Usage:
  olr firewall show [flags]
  olr firewall show [command]

Available Commands:
  forward     Show one port forward in full
  forwards    List the ports being forwarded in

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr firewall show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
